# Local credentials and login notes

Use this directory for real Google Cloud credentials and local demo login notes.
Only `.example` files are eligible for Git; keep their content as placeholders.

- google-translate-key.json.example documents the credential structure. Obtain
  the real JSON file from your Google Cloud service account and save it as
  google-translate-key.json. The placeholder file cannot authenticate.
- DEMO_LOGINS.local.md.example is an outline for private demo account notes.
  Copy it to DEMO_LOGINS.local.md before entering any real credentials.

Set OPENROUTER_API_KEY in the project root `.env`, using `.env.example` as the
template. The translation code automatically checks the real JSON path here.
